WEBVTT

00:00:05.434 --> 00:00:08.335
The Irresponsible Captain
Tylor

00:00:09.038 --> 00:00:11.907
We may be off the maps...
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:11.907 --> 00:00:13.966
...but let's stay on this voyage.
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:18.940
I will be holding, never let you go.

00:00:20.516 --> 00:00:23.352
Whatever we may want...
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:23.352 --> 00:00:25.479
...we'll take as we need.
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:26.255 --> 00:00:30.282
So let's just go wherever we please!
Omoi no Mama Yukou!

00:00:31.994 --> 00:00:34.763
Make me your partner...
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:34.763 --> 00:00:37.391
...on this journey.
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:37.666 --> 00:00:41.261
One that you trust more than words!
Michizure ni Shite

00:00:42.705 --> 00:00:47.369
Come on now and sail away for future!
Imasugu sail away for future

00:00:48.377 --> 00:00:49.878
Things are waiting...
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:49.878 --> 00:00:53.075
...that we've never seen before!
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:54.917 --> 00:00:57.086
Just take your cares...
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:00:57.086 --> 00:01:01.147
...and throw them all away.
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:01:01.390 --> 00:01:06.020
Come together, just think of tomorrow.

00:01:07.796 --> 00:01:09.286
Let's go!

00:01:12.568 --> 00:01:16.004
THE UNJUST DESERT

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:35.514
Wait a minute! I know we all
cleared the biohazard screening!

00:01:35.658 --> 00:01:41.619
Sorry, but they decided it wasn't
effective on unknown viruses.

00:01:42.364 --> 00:01:46.357
This is a violation of our rights!
I demand to speak with headquarters!

00:01:46.702 --> 00:01:48.533
This is their decision!

00:01:49.371 --> 00:01:50.201
It can't be!

00:01:51.707 --> 00:01:53.402
Oh, they've fixed us good!

00:01:54.043 --> 00:01:58.946
They're probably using the virus
as an excuse to keep us locked up!

00:01:59.581 --> 00:02:01.446
They've gotta be kidding!

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:11.956
For just this once,
I appreciate the Raalgon.

00:02:12.094 --> 00:02:13.288
You said it.

00:02:14.697 --> 00:02:20.101
Although I do feel sorry
for the rest of his crew.

00:02:20.402 --> 00:02:23.166
Come, come.
That's not something...

00:02:23.238 --> 00:02:25.570
...I'd expect a seasoned
warrior like you to say.

00:02:26.675 --> 00:02:31.840
Or could it be even you feel
some pity for Tylor as well?

00:02:32.681 --> 00:02:33.477
Ridiculous!

00:02:34.083 --> 00:02:37.780
Even if I did,
it's beside the point.

00:02:38.253 --> 00:02:42.883
He was probably executed right
after the Raalgon got him!

00:02:43.525 --> 00:02:46.255
You're treating us like criminals!

00:02:46.729 --> 00:02:50.096
We're following the manual and
putting you in quarantine!

00:02:50.799 --> 00:02:51.766
Try to understand!

00:02:52.434 --> 00:02:56.029
Please! The captain's been
captured by the Raalgon Empire!

00:02:56.338 --> 00:02:57.805
We canвЂ™t just stay here!

00:02:58.107 --> 00:03:00.473
If he's been captured by the
Raalgon, then it's too late.

00:03:01.243 --> 00:03:02.403
They'll execute him!

00:03:02.745 --> 00:03:05.578
Execute him? Oh, no...

00:03:11.754 --> 00:03:12.652
Execute him...

00:03:22.131 --> 00:03:27.262
CAPTAIN!!!

00:03:37.846 --> 00:03:41.077
Highness! Have you had
time to consider...

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:44.313
...the plan I recently
submitted for dispatching...

00:03:44.653 --> 00:03:46.587
...a fleet to
annihilate the UPSF?

00:03:50.325 --> 00:03:52.418
The plan to dispatch
all our forces?

00:03:52.728 --> 00:03:53.353
Yes.

00:03:53.896 --> 00:03:58.196
I've no objections, but I don't
care for your personally leading it.

00:03:58.534 --> 00:03:59.967
I see. But...

00:04:00.102 --> 00:04:03.672
Highness, if Admiral Lonawer
personally leads the battle...

00:04:03.672 --> 00:04:06.308
...it would raise all our
troops' morale greatly!

00:04:06.308 --> 00:04:07.206
General!

00:04:07.409 --> 00:04:08.239
General?

00:04:08.677 --> 00:04:10.736
Even without a morale boost...

00:04:10.946 --> 00:04:12.914
...the Raalgon are
pretty strong as it is.

00:04:13.715 --> 00:04:15.478
I'm the prime minister,
not a general!

00:04:16.151 --> 00:04:19.643
Highness, I beg of you to
make your decision quickly!

00:04:20.289 --> 00:04:21.187
But...

00:04:22.024 --> 00:04:24.326
Now, look, General.
Even assuming...

00:04:24.326 --> 00:04:26.191
Prime minister, not general!

00:04:28.197 --> 00:04:31.792
But what'll you do if the admiral
gets killed in the battle?

00:04:34.436 --> 00:04:38.304
Oh, I see! You probably
wouldn't mind that at all!

00:04:38.907 --> 00:04:40.340
Wha- What did you?!

00:04:40.442 --> 00:04:43.070
You should take care of
the elderly, you know.

00:04:43.378 --> 00:04:45.676
How dare you! Who are
you calling elderly?!

00:04:45.747 --> 00:04:49.376
Enough! I'm sure Paco-Paco is
only concerned with your safety.

00:04:49.885 --> 00:04:51.216
Just as I am.

00:04:51.587 --> 00:04:55.182
But, Highness, by deploying
our entire force...

00:04:55.257 --> 00:04:59.127
...he will have both the means
and the popular support to win.

00:04:59.127 --> 00:05:01.595
In that case,
why don't you go?

00:05:03.232 --> 00:05:07.168
Impossible. I must stay at
Her Imperial Highness' side...

00:05:07.236 --> 00:05:11.640
...as a loyal servant to
serve as her valued advisor.

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:15.303
Then you should show the same
value to the old man, General!

00:05:15.611 --> 00:05:16.771
Why, you!

00:05:16.979 --> 00:05:21.382
Wang, I agree with Paco-Paco.
What is your opinion?

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:24.981
Highness, I believe it is my
duty to remain at your side...

00:05:25.053 --> 00:05:27.886
...passionately serving
as your loyal advisor!

00:05:27.956 --> 00:05:29.480
Oh, NOW I get it!

00:05:30.325 --> 00:05:32.589
I thought you were
too old for that!

00:05:33.028 --> 00:05:34.052
Whoops.

00:05:35.597 --> 00:05:38.225
You've got a thing for sweet,
little Azalyn, don't you?

00:05:39.468 --> 00:05:45.440
Ridiculous! Even if I had such
vulgar feelings for Her Highness...

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:47.704
...nothing could
ever come of it!

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:52.438
Oh? Then why are you so hot
on staying close to Azalyn?

00:05:54.049 --> 00:05:58.713
Maybe to kiss up to her?
Get yourself some special favors?

00:05:59.621 --> 00:06:00.952
Nonsense.

00:06:02.624 --> 00:06:03.716
Which means...

00:06:04.293 --> 00:06:09.498
...you want to stay with her
so you can control her...

00:06:09.498 --> 00:06:11.966
How dare you!
You're nothing but her pet!

00:06:12.067 --> 00:06:15.366
I should have them shut that
impertinent mouth permanently!

00:06:15.637 --> 00:06:18.333
Release him, Wang. That's enough.

00:06:19.641 --> 00:06:21.233
Paco-Paco, come!

00:06:21.643 --> 00:06:22.803
Okay!

00:06:26.648 --> 00:06:28.673
Ow! He kicked me!

00:06:28.984 --> 00:06:30.918
Because you were being naughty.

00:06:32.554 --> 00:06:35.148
I'm sorry, Wang.
Please forgive him.

00:06:35.657 --> 00:06:38.182
Yes, Highness.
Thank you for your concern.

00:06:53.342 --> 00:06:54.240
Check!

00:06:56.345 --> 00:06:57.903
So, that was your strategy.

00:06:58.981 --> 00:07:00.676
No take-backs, Doctor.

00:07:01.049 --> 00:07:03.210
Well, what if I do this?

00:07:03.452 --> 00:07:05.613
Huh?! Wait, I, l...

00:07:05.687 --> 00:07:08.520
No take-backs for you, either!

00:07:16.198 --> 00:07:18.359
Lieutenant,
please try to cheer up.

00:07:20.335 --> 00:07:23.793
I know how you feel, but being
depressed won't help anything.

00:07:26.141 --> 00:07:29.008
The captain... The captain
behaved magnificently!

00:07:29.378 --> 00:07:31.005
And I, on the other hand...

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:33.371
I live on here in disgrace!

00:07:34.716 --> 00:07:37.810
I should have shared
the captain's fate!

00:07:38.353 --> 00:07:41.288
I'm ashamed! I'm so ashamed!

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:43.184
He's taking it hard.

00:08:10.052 --> 00:08:14.284
Tylor, it appears your crew
has been imprisoned.

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:16.853
Don't you want to save them?

00:08:18.427 --> 00:08:19.553
Why would I?

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:35.467
Brainwashing...
Can there be a worse fate?

00:08:39.081 --> 00:08:43.245
I'm sick of it! Why do we
hafta be locked up like this?!

00:08:43.919 --> 00:08:46.979
Complaining about it
isn't going help us.

00:08:47.255 --> 00:08:50.486
What?! Don't get smart with
me, you snotty-nosed kid!

00:08:51.326 --> 00:08:54.659
Snotty... nosed!!!

00:08:55.063 --> 00:08:57.930
WHY, YOU!!!
YOU PIECE OF!!!

00:09:00.068 --> 00:09:01.126
Who are you betting on?

00:09:01.269 --> 00:09:03.100
The sergeant, of course...

00:09:03.171 --> 00:09:05.002
...is what I'd like to say.

00:09:05.474 --> 00:09:07.066
You have no loyalty.

00:09:07.175 --> 00:09:10.611
Relationships don't count
in a bet. That's the rules!

00:09:11.813 --> 00:09:13.576
You big idiot!

00:09:26.495 --> 00:09:30.056
If it has to end here,
then I... I!

00:09:30.499 --> 00:09:35.869
Captain! Your unworthy
Yamamoto is coming to your side!

00:09:44.846 --> 00:09:47.815
Can't... Can't breathe!

00:09:50.952 --> 00:09:54.388
Okay, who's pulling him down?
Push him UP!

00:09:55.857 --> 00:09:58.826
I'm dying! Help me!

00:10:04.199 --> 00:10:06.030
What's going on in there?!
Be quiet!

00:10:08.236 --> 00:10:12.764
God damn it! What'd we
ever do to deserve this?

00:10:13.175 --> 00:10:16.576
What do you think?!
This is all Tylor's fault!

00:10:16.978 --> 00:10:20.470
That lousy! He'd better
not get himself killed...

00:10:20.549 --> 00:10:23.518
...before I get to do it myself!

00:10:27.422 --> 00:10:29.481
Sounds like they stopped
before anyone got hurt.

00:10:29.624 --> 00:10:30.181
Oh.

00:10:30.559 --> 00:10:32.959
I know how they feel, though.

00:10:33.094 --> 00:10:35.995
Are we going to be locked in
here for the rest of our lives?

00:10:36.565 --> 00:10:38.396
I don't want that!

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:42.094
I'm sorry.
This is all my fault.

00:10:42.571 --> 00:10:43.367
That's right.

00:10:44.306 --> 00:10:47.798
Harumi, if you really
feel that way...

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:50.505
...then maybe you should
take responsibility.

00:10:50.645 --> 00:10:51.202
Huh?!

00:10:51.279 --> 00:10:52.013
Commander?

00:10:52.013 --> 00:10:54.641
You're a top-class
Raalgon spy, aren't you?

00:10:54.916 --> 00:10:56.247
Why are you
bringing that up now?!

00:10:56.451 --> 00:10:58.510
Tell me, if you're a spy...

00:10:59.821 --> 00:11:02.483
If you're a spy, how would
you break out of here?

00:12:07.722 --> 00:12:10.054
They're being awfully
quiet, aren't they?

00:12:10.558 --> 00:12:13.789
Yeah, guess that fight they
had before tired them out.

00:12:14.029 --> 00:12:15.155
What did you say?!

00:12:21.469 --> 00:12:22.671
Hey! What are you doing?!

00:12:22.671 --> 00:12:23.438
Stop that!

00:12:23.438 --> 00:12:28.273
Stop them, quick!
Andressen's gonna kill Katori!

00:12:28.610 --> 00:12:30.407
You like that, you little?!

00:12:30.679 --> 00:12:34.479
He will! The guy doesn't
know his own strength!

00:12:34.916 --> 00:12:36.941
He isn't a gentleman, like me!

00:12:37.385 --> 00:12:38.875
Sheesh... Gimme a break!

00:12:47.062 --> 00:12:48.596
I can't breathe!

00:12:48.596 --> 00:12:49.824
Hang on!

00:12:50.065 --> 00:12:53.262
It's a relapse!
Hurry, do something!

00:12:53.401 --> 00:12:54.026
Hey!

00:13:09.084 --> 00:13:12.713
Idiot! You expect me to
excuse your letting them escape?!

00:13:13.388 --> 00:13:16.357
Didn't I say we had to watch
out for Tylor's people?!

00:13:16.558 --> 00:13:17.792
If we don't stop them...

00:13:17.792 --> 00:13:18.986
Arrest them at once!

00:13:19.427 --> 00:13:22.328
If they resist,
we'll just have to kill them.

00:13:30.105 --> 00:13:32.164
Excuse me,
where are you going?

00:13:32.440 --> 00:13:37.145
We need an ambulance to take
a patient to the general ward.

00:13:37.145 --> 00:13:41.514
Oh. Um, but I wasn't
told about this...

00:13:41.683 --> 00:13:45.517
You idiot! We just
heard about this ourselves.

00:13:45.754 --> 00:13:48.621
Damn it, the brass at HQ couldn't
care less how busy I am...

00:13:48.690 --> 00:13:51.659
...and ordered me to do
something else for them!

00:13:51.893 --> 00:13:55.351
It's not like I want
to be doing this!

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:58.490
Sure, fine. I won't do it.
As long as YOU take responsibility!

00:13:59.134 --> 00:14:01.659
Uh, no, sir! Sorry, sir!

00:14:02.137 --> 00:14:03.604
You're a credit to
your profession, sir!

00:14:04.472 --> 00:14:06.531
So are you. Thank you.

00:14:26.628 --> 00:14:29.096
So, where do we go now?

00:14:29.497 --> 00:14:31.089
You have to ask?

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:33.432
I'm in!

00:14:33.935 --> 00:14:36.062
I think our plan's settled.

00:14:37.472 --> 00:14:39.872
We're going to save Mr. Tylor!

00:14:57.192 --> 00:14:59.922
The Soyokaze crew has
escaped from quarantine!

00:15:00.028 --> 00:15:01.290
Arrest them at once!

00:15:01.529 --> 00:15:03.827
Get a roadblock set up
around the dock area!

00:15:04.199 --> 00:15:05.894
The deserters are armed!

00:15:06.167 --> 00:15:07.794
If they resist,
use lethal force!

00:15:12.540 --> 00:15:15.168
Damn! They're onto us!

00:15:15.610 --> 00:15:18.101
Stop at once
or we'll open fire!

00:15:28.523 --> 00:15:31.651
You idiots!
You're actually shooting at us?!

00:15:34.562 --> 00:15:35.290
Hang on!

00:15:45.807 --> 00:15:48.207
Okay, we've got 'em!
Close the shutter!

00:15:49.577 --> 00:15:51.135
Like fish in a barrel!

00:15:52.614 --> 00:15:56.675
They're trapped in passage 13!
Seal off the exit!

00:15:56.818 --> 00:16:00.549
Roger! Okay, everyone,
take your positions!

00:16:09.964 --> 00:16:10.862
Here it comes!

00:16:17.939 --> 00:16:19.201
Fire!

00:16:42.897 --> 00:16:43.955
I don't believe it!

00:16:44.632 --> 00:16:45.496
How could they?!

00:16:46.467 --> 00:16:47.764
I told you.

00:16:48.303 --> 00:16:52.137
The brass were planning to
kill us from the start!

00:16:56.144 --> 00:16:56.803
Empty!

00:16:56.878 --> 00:16:59.005
Same here! Nobody inside!

00:17:00.915 --> 00:17:02.644
Damn! They tricked us!

00:17:17.498 --> 00:17:18.624
It's all right!

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:22.758
I was worried they might have
started cannibalizing it already.

00:17:23.571 --> 00:17:25.266
Of course they haven't.

00:17:25.573 --> 00:17:28.633
What? You mean you
weren't worried, Commander?

00:17:29.811 --> 00:17:33.542
Come on, have you ever seen
a ship with so much dumb luck?

00:17:33.848 --> 00:17:36.874
So, "like captain,
like ship", huh?

00:17:37.619 --> 00:17:38.517
No kidding!

00:17:39.354 --> 00:17:42.812
That's right. We have to believe.
That the captain...

00:17:43.691 --> 00:17:45.556
That the captain's
still alive, too!

00:17:47.695 --> 00:17:48.787
That's right.

00:17:49.397 --> 00:17:53.197
Damn it, Tylor, you'd better
stay alive till I can kill you!

00:17:53.301 --> 00:17:55.667
Wait, I want
a crack at him, too.

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:59.770
Come on, let's get on board
before they come after us.

00:18:00.041 --> 00:18:01.099
Don't move!

00:18:03.678 --> 00:18:06.841
Throw down your guns
and return to quarantine!

00:18:08.249 --> 00:18:09.307
It's over.

00:18:09.484 --> 00:18:12.553
Like hell it is!
Not without a fight!

00:18:12.553 --> 00:18:13.042
No!

00:18:30.405 --> 00:18:33.306
Get the auxiliary
lights on! Move it!

00:18:35.410 --> 00:18:36.069
What the?!

00:18:43.418 --> 00:18:44.612
Is that?!

00:18:45.386 --> 00:18:46.284
The virus?!

00:18:46.754 --> 00:18:47.812
They're relapsing!

00:18:53.761 --> 00:18:54.420
Hey!

00:19:03.037 --> 00:19:04.163
Wait for me!

00:19:17.452 --> 00:19:19.545
What just happened?

00:19:19.754 --> 00:19:23.747
To put it simply,
we just got a full pardon.

00:19:24.325 --> 00:19:25.121
Exactly.

00:19:25.460 --> 00:19:26.085
Right!

00:19:35.803 --> 00:19:39.330
A-A-Admiral, sir!
l... I couldn't help it!

00:19:41.476 --> 00:19:43.444
P-P-Please calm down!

00:19:52.820 --> 00:19:57.018
It's all his fault!
Everything is his fault!

00:20:07.835 --> 00:20:09.234
Well, Lieutenant?

00:20:12.206 --> 00:20:16.370
Come on, Mr. First Officer!
Everyone's waiting for your orders.

00:20:19.147 --> 00:20:20.876
Come on, hurry up!

00:20:21.315 --> 00:20:22.748
I know, but...

00:20:23.818 --> 00:20:25.308
But...

00:20:25.953 --> 00:20:27.147
Lieutenant Yamamoto.

00:20:34.095 --> 00:20:36.222
Well, then,
if I may be so bold...

00:20:39.534 --> 00:20:41.525
Full speed ahead!

00:20:52.547 --> 00:20:54.344
Let's go!

00:21:58.946 --> 00:22:01.972
Attention, all ships!
Attention, all ships!

00:22:02.450 --> 00:22:07.615
Destroy the Soyokaze!
Destroy the Soyokaze!

00:22:12.560 --> 00:22:13.549
The Irresponsible Captain Tylor
Next Episode

00:22:14.862 --> 00:22:16.659
A first love which carries
the scent of gunpowder.

00:22:16.764 --> 00:22:18.391
A confession that tempts
a person towards death.

00:22:18.699 --> 00:22:22.465
Where will an innocent
girl's love lead her?

00:22:22.870 --> 00:22:24.838
Next time,
"A Place for Confession."

00:22:25.072 --> 00:22:25.473
Watch for it.

00:22:25.473 --> 00:22:25.973
Filming is Job 1!
Working hard for those who demand
the finest in image and sound
Watch for it.

00:22:25.973 --> 00:22:27.338
Filming is Job 1!
Working hard for those who demand
the finest in image and sound

00:22:38.486 --> 00:22:41.589
All he has to do is just...
Machi o Aitsu ga Aruiteru dake de

00:22:41.589 --> 00:22:44.683
...walk around downtown.
Machi o Aitsu ga Aruiteru dake de

00:22:45.192 --> 00:22:48.663
He's a playful man who catches...
Nandemo Ki o Hiku Ochame na Yatsu sa

00:22:48.663 --> 00:22:51.496
...the eyes of all who he meets.
Nandemo Ki o Hiku Ochame na Yatsu sa

00:22:51.999 --> 00:22:54.835
Oh! That's why, you see...
Aa, Dakara sa Sou Kore kara Shuyaku

00:22:54.835 --> 00:22:58.635
...he'll be our hero from now on.
Aa, Dakara sa Sou Kore kara Shuyaku

00:22:59.440 --> 00:23:01.809
So, let's begin...
Henshin Byouyomi o Shite yo!

00:23:01.809 --> 00:23:05.643
...the countdown for the change!
Henshin Byouyomi o Shite yo!

00:23:09.116 --> 00:23:11.914
Take a deep breath, and one two.
12345 Ikizugi o One Two

